      "content": "SP 9708 NW 6/153 NORTHCHURCH HIGH STREET (south side), Nos. 69 to 73 (odd) GV II C17.  Colour-washed brick, tiled roof. Two storeys, flush casements, mostly with glazing bars. On right altered early C19 shop front with glazing bars. Nos. 69 to 79 (odd) form a group Listing NGR: SP9747908705 This asset was previously listed twice. The duplicate record (List entry number 1100402) was removed from the List on 15/01/2019."
